em><title><![CDATA[Suicide blast at Islamabad mosque kills 31, MEA snubs Pak claim of Indian hand]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128014433.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A devastating suicide bombing at a Shia mosque in Islamabad on Friday claimed at least 31 lives and injured over 170, marking the capital's deadliest attack since 2008. The bomber detonated himself at the mosque's entrance after Friday prayers. Pakistan's Defence Minister alleged Indian sponsorship, a claim India vehemently rejected as baseless and a diversion from domestic issues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/suicide-blast-at-islamabad-mosque-kills-31-mea-snubs-pak-claim-of-indian-hand/articleshow/128014433.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/suicide-blast-at-islamabad-mosque-kills-31-mea-snubs-pak-claim-of-indian-hand/articleshow/128014433.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-07T05:47:59+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128014459,imgsize-1564231.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Epstein’s deathbed will: Who stood to inherit multimillion-dollar fortune, and what about the victims?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/127996546.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Newly released Justice Department records reveal how Jeffrey Epstein sought to distribute his fortune through a trust signed two days before his death in 2019. While the document named dozens of beneficiaries, including his girlfriend, lawyer and accountant, it made no provision for victims. Years of litigation and compensation payments have since dramatically reduced the estate’s value.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epsteins-deathbed-will-who-stood-to-inherit-multimillion-dollar-fortune-and-what-about-the-victims/articleshow/127996546.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epsteins-deathbed-will-who-stood-to-inherit-multimillion-dollar-fortune-and-what-about-the-victims/articleshow/127996546.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-07T03:46:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128010361,imgsize-148880.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US accuses China of secret N-tests in 2020]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128009899.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-accuses-china-of-secret-n-tests-in-2020/articleshow/128009899.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-accuses-china-of-secret-n-tests-in-2020/articleshow/128009899.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-07T03:27:29+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128009899,imgsize-957767.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Norway's Crown Princess apologises for Epstein link, says she did not understand who he was; husband backs her]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128008435.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/norways-crown-princess-apologises-for-epstein-link-says-she-did-not-understand-who-he-was-husband-backs-her/articleshow/128008435.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/norways-crown-princess-apologises-for-epstein-link-says-she-did-not-understand-who-he-was-husband-backs-her/articleshow/128008435.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-07T02